sequenceDiagram
    participant Client

    box Backend
        participant CommentService
        participant DB
    end

    Client->>CommentService: POST /comments {content, commit_ids: [...]}
    CommentService->>CommentService: Validate session cookie
    CommentService->>DB: INSERT comment
    DB-->>CommentService: comment_id
    CommentService->>DB: INSERT anchors for each commit_id
    DB-->>CommentService: OK
    CommentService-->>Client: 201 Created
    